sp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2017</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">학년도 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">학기부터 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">C+</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">이하만 재수강 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">변경은 정해진 기간 이외에는 할 수 없음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청 공지사항 첨부물</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청 안내문</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">교육과정표 필독</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">을 숙지한 후 신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">계약학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, IT</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">융합학과 개설 강좌</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">교양</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">전공 불문</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">는 수강신청 불가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○</span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#ef0b0b\"> </font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#f42222\"><strong>교직이수 학과의 진급하는 2학년인 학생은 교직 신청 가능함</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강지도상담 결과 조회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강지도상담 승인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">미승인 내역은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">원스톱서비스</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">상담</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강지도상담</span></u></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">에서 조회 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -18.3pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">본인의 수강신청 소홀 및 대리수강신청 등에 따른 착오로 인하여 졸업을 하지 못하는 학생이 매학기 발생하고 있으니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청을 소홀히 하여 불이익을 당하지 않도록 유의하여야 합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">특히 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2006</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">학년도부터 공학교육인증과정이 도입되었으니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2016</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">학년도 교육과정표 내 본인 학과 교육과정을 확실히 숙지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강지도상담 필요</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">한 후 수강신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -18.3pt; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2016. 2. 1. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
